odai their former classmate and Tsukubu's captain. Finally Sakuragi is irked by the presence of Nango, Tsukubu's center, who vies for Haruko's attention."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"スラムダンク 全国制覇だ！桜木花道","overview":"湘北は、インターハイ予選において、ベスト16に進出。次の対戦相手は、赤木と木暮の中学時代のバスケ仲間の伍代友和と安西の大学監督時代の教え子・川崎一美が属する古豪・津久武。  3試合連続無得点退場で苛立っている花道は、津久武のルーキーである南郷洸一郎と晴子のことで揉めた上、晴子との交際もかけて、南郷とも争うことになった。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezrqjFixcd2XpzZu3A1bYyMLqKg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ezrqjFixcd2XpzZu3A1bYyMLqKg.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5NJKxIwL82wYkTB3qHJzkywunEi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5NJKxIwL82wYkTB3qHJzkywunEi.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cYoALich4zxk5DfiB7TobbdmH16.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cYoALich4zxk5DfiB7TobbdmH16.jpg","language":"ja","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bxRIhopkEVULkPoK0uEcDwlHWg6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bxRIhopkEVULkPoK0uEcDwlHWg6.jpg","language":"ja","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKOIgZ1pMGUE0Q17x7huuGobODa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cKOIgZ1pMGUE0Q17x7huuGobODa.jpg","language":"ja","width":1630,"height":2445},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bcpDTYiKfgLC5q9bOQpFv2It5Ks.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bcpDTYiKfgLC5q9bOQpFv2It5Ks.jpg","language":"ja","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/97PnJGDjDTn3WjsEK1XQQDETzuj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/97PnJGDjDTn3WjsEK1XQQDETzuj.jpg","language":"ja","width":1495,"height":2240},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCy1aaZeDybiLtTh